namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamMaskTransition {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/DreamMaskTransition.h#DreamMaskTransition
    src   "Reveals or hides a widget and everything under it through a moving mask: a wipe, a clock, an iris, blinds, a checker\nboard, a dissolve, a blot of ink, shards, or a texture's order. Progress runs 0 (hidden) to 1 (shown) -- the other way\nwith Invert -- and can be driven by a tween (PlayForward, PlayBackward), a widget animation's property track, or\nBlueprint.\n\nIt drives the widget's clip mask (UDreamWidget::SetDrivenClipMask) without touching the Clip Mask the widget was\ngiven, so nothing of it is saved; while it drives one, a widget that did not clip to its bounds does. Fully shown, it\nlets go of the mask and costs nothing; fully hidden, nothing under it can be hit."
    text  "通过移动的遮罩显示或隐藏控件及其下方的所有内容：擦除、时钟、光圈、百叶窗、棋盘、\n溶解、墨迹、碎片，或纹理的顺序。Progress 从 0（隐藏）变化到 1（显示）——使用 Invert 时\n方向相反——并可由补间（PlayForward、PlayBackward）、控件动画的属性轨道或\n蓝图驱动。\n\n它驱动控件的裁剪遮罩（UDreamWidget::SetDrivenClipMask），而不改动控件原本获得的\nClip Mask，因此其状态不会被保存；在它驱动期间，原本不裁剪到自身边界的控件也会裁剪。完全显示时，它\n放开遮罩且不产生开销；完全隐藏时，其下方的任何内容都无法被命中。"
    state machine
}

DreamMaskTransition:Angle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/DreamMaskTransition.h#DreamMaskTransition:Angle
    src   "Degrees clockwise the Wipe, Clock and Blinds shapes are turned."
    text  "擦除、时钟和百叶窗形状顺时针旋转的角度。"
    state machine
}

DreamMaskTransition:bEnabled {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/DreamMaskTransition.h#DreamMaskTransition:bEnabled
    src   "Off, the widget is shown whole whatever the progress: to compare with and without the transition."
    text  "关闭时，无论进度如何，控件都完整显示：用于对比有过渡和无过渡的效果。"
    state machine
}

DreamMaskTransition:bHitTestMask {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/DreamMaskTransition.h#DreamMaskTransition:bHitTestMask
    src   "Clicks follow the mask while it moves, where the mask can be measured without a texture (Wipe, Clock, Iris, Diamond,\nBlinds, Dissolve); the others hit the whole rect until they are shown. Hidden, nothing is hit either way."
    text  "遮罩移动时点击跟随遮罩，仅限无需纹理即可测量遮罩的形状（擦除、时钟、光圈、菱形、\n百叶窗、溶解）；其他形状在显示之前，整个矩形都会被命中。隐藏时，两种情况下都不会命中任何内容。"
    state machine
}

DreamMaskTransition:bInvert {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/DreamMaskTransition.h#DreamMaskTransition:bInvert
    src   "Hides as Progress rises, by the same shape: what was shown first goes first."
    text  "随 Progress 上升而以相同的形状隐藏：先显示的内容先消失。"
    state machine
}

DreamMaskTransition:bReverse {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/DreamMaskTransition.h#DreamMaskTransition:bReverse
    src   "Runs the shape the other way: a wipe from the right, a clock anticlockwise, an iris closing in from the edge."
    text  "以相反方向运行形状：擦除从右侧开始，时钟逆时针，光圈从边缘向内收拢。"
    state machine
}

DreamMaskTransition:Centre {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/DreamMaskTransition.h#DreamMaskTransition:Centre
