DreamMaskTransition:CrossFade {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/DreamMaskTransition.h#DreamMaskTransition:CrossFade
    src   "InFrom gives way to InTo through one shape over InDuration seconds: InTo is revealed exactly where InFrom is hidden,\npixel for pixel. Each gets a transition of InPreset if it has none (its other settings kept, so that both match when\nset alike); InFrom ends fully hidden, InTo fully shown. Either may be null."
    text  "InFrom 在 InDuration 秒内通过同一种形状过渡为 InTo：InTo 恰好在 InFrom 隐藏的位置，\n逐像素显现。若某一方没有过渡，则获得 InPreset 预设的过渡（保留其其他设置，以便在设置相同时\n二者一致）；InFrom 最终完全隐藏，InTo 完全显示。二者均可为 null。"
    state machine
}

