DreamMaskTransition:PlayScreenTransition {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/DreamMaskTransition.h#DreamMaskTransition:PlayScreenTransition
    src   "A transition of the whole screen: a cover of InColour put on the viewport above the pages, revealed by InPreset over\nInCoverSeconds; OnCovered then (load the next level, swap the screen), InHoldSeconds later the cover hides by the\nsame shape over InUncoverSeconds, and is taken off the screen; OnFinished then. Returns the cover's transition, whose\nsettings can still be changed while it covers. Null where there is no screen to cover."
    text  "整个屏幕的过渡：将 InColour 的遮盖层放在视口上、页面之上，由 InPreset 预设于\nInCoverSeconds 内揭示；随后调用 OnCovered（加载下一关卡、切换屏幕），InHoldSeconds 后遮盖层以同一\n形状在 InUncoverSeconds 内隐藏，并从屏幕上移除；随后调用 OnFinished。返回遮盖层的过渡，其\n设置可在遮盖期间继续更改。没有可遮盖的屏幕时返回 null。"
    state machine
}

